3eStrengths:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eWeaknesses:\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eWhy you fell you could help this team:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Skype Username (This\r\nis a must have)\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eWhat position do you play in:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eThank you for you time and I can’t wait to see you on the\r\nbattlefield \u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eContact Details \u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eSkype aiden.scheide2\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003eEmail \u003ca href=\"mailto:35200@jisedu.or.id\" title=\"Link: mailto:35200@jisedu.or.id\"\u003e35200@jisedu.or.id\u003c/a\u003e\r\n\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003c!--EndFragment--\u003e","created_at":1427976939,"title":"Skull Crushers","replies":[]}